1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,486
Now the cases Mendel never met.

2
00:00:02,486 --> 00:00:08,359
In the four o'clock plant, Mirabilis jalapa, red crossed with white gives pink.

3
00:00:08,359 --> 00:00:13,710
Neither allele is fully dominant, so the heterozygote is in between.

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,950
That is incomplete dominance.

